103
00:04:07,686 --> 00:04:08,875
By our arithmetic,

104
00:04:08,875 --> 00:04:10,725
six weeks is forty-two days,

105
00:04:10,725 --> 00:04:12,773
which is about a quarter of the

106
00:04:12,773 --> 00:04:15,349
